{"id":190,"gn":"Pokémon Longqueue","ft":["Sa queue est aussi agile que ses mains. Il vit en haut des grands arbres.","Il vit sur les plus hautes cimes. Sautant de branche en branche, sa queue lui assure un bon équilibre.","Sa queue est si forte qu’il peut l’utiliser pour se suspendre aux branches des arbres.","L’extrémité de la queue de Capumain ressemble à une main et peut être utilisée de façon ingénieuse. Malheureusement, ce Pokémon utilise tellement sa queue que ses véritables mains sont devenues très maladroites.","À force d’utiliser sa queue à tort et à travers, elle est devenue plus habile que ses mains. Il l’utilise pour faire son nid en haut des arbres.","Il guette ses proies depuis la cime des arbres. Quand il aperçoit un Croquine, son mets préféré, il se jette dessus."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":1,"24":2,"25":3,"26":3,"29":4,"30":5},"gr":4,"cr":45,"hc":20,"bh":70,"eg":["Terrestre"],"gw":"fast","gm":{"svmask":[0,47],"sv":[1,47],"la":[0,78],"bdsp":[0,63],"usum":[0,368],"usum*":[3,115],"hgss":[0,123],"pt":[0,63],"dp":[0,63],"c":[0,122],"gs":[0,122]},"f":{"190":{"n":"Capumain","t":["normal"],"s":[55,70,55,40,55,85],"h":0.8,"w":11.5,"a":[[50,0],[53,0],[92,1]],"pa":[[4,[[50,0],[53,0]]]],"av":["svmask","sv","la","bdsp","usum","hgss","pt","dp","c","gs"],"ls":[{"l":[[10,1],[39,1],[28,4],[310,8],[226,11],[321,15],[154,18],[129,22],[103,25],[97,29],[458,32],[374,36],[417,39],[387,43]],"m":[7,8,9,36,38,67,76,85,86,87,91,97,118,129,156,164,168,180,182,189,203,214,226,240,241,247,263,264,269,270,280,282,283,332,341,352,369,374,402,417,421,441,447,479,490,492,512,675,851,885,886,918],"e":[21,68,231,251,252,340,343,415,501]},{"l":[[98,1],[417,6],[129,11],[426,18],[458,25],[231,34],[38,43]]},{"l":[[10,1],[39,1],[28,4],[310,8],[226,11],[321,15],[154,18],[129,22],[103,25],[97,29],[458,32],[374,36],[417,39],[387,43]],"m":[15,70,76,85,86,87,91,104,138,156,164,168,182,203,207,213,214,231,240,241,247,249,263,264,269,280,332,351,352,369,371,374,417,421,447,490,526],"e":[21,68,97,